  "description": "UXESEY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H58 Dy4 N8 O36 Si8 2-,2(C8 H20 N1 1+),2.5(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.681-3.731 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.57-107.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (Et4N)2[(PhSiO1.5)8(DyO1.5)4(O)(NO2.5)6(EtOH)2(MeCN)2].",
